sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant P as Population
    participant L as LLM Provider
    participant S as Sandbox
    participant V as Verifier
    participant R as Reflector
    participant E as Evaluator
    participant C as Checkpoint

    O->>P: select parents (elitism + diversity)
    P-->>O: parent set
    loop each offspring
        O->>L: generate(problem, parent, reflection)
        L-->>O: candidate code
        O->>S: run candidate (isolated, timeout)
        S-->>O: output / timeout / crash
        O->>V: verify(candidate, universe)
        V-->>O: result per sequence
        alt candidate fails
            O->>R: analyze(failing case)
            R->>L: structured reflection
            L-->>O: repair hint
        end
        O->>E: fitness + work_ratio
        E-->>O: score
        O->>P: add / select survivors
    end
    O->>C: commit generation state (atomic)
    C-->>O: checkpointed
    O-->>O: Dashboard export at milestone
